<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<title>Segmentya — Potenciá tus datos, Incrementá tus resultados</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,300;1,400&display=swap');
:root{--brand:#C14A1C;--brand2:#E8521A;--dark:#0F0F0F;--gray:#5A5A5A;--light:#F7F6F4;--border:#EBEBEB;--white:#FFFFFF;}
*,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:var(--white);color:var(--dark);overflow-x:hidden;}
nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;padding:14px 56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:rgba(255,255,255,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--border);transition:all .3s;}
.nav-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;text-decoration:none;}
.nav-logo img{height:44px;display:block;}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;}
.nav-link{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--gray);background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;transition:color .18s;}
.nav-link:hover{color:var(--dark);}
.nav-cta{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;padding:10px 22px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;transition:all .18s;}
.nav-cta:hover{background:#a83d17;transform:translateY(-1px);}
.hamburger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:6px;}
.hamburger span{display:block;width:22px;height:2px;background:var(--gray);border-radius:2px;transition:all .3s;}
.hamburger.open span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(7px) rotate(45deg);}
.hamburger.open span:nth-child(2){opacity:0;}
.hamburger.open span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg);}
.mobile-menu{display:none;position:fixed;top:61px;left:0;right:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.98);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);padding:16px 24px 24px;z-index:99;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);flex-direction:column;gap:2px;box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.08);}
.mobile-menu.open{display:flex;}
.mobile-link{background:none;border:none;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;color:var(--dark);padding:13px 10px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px;transition:background .15s;}
.mobile-link:hover{background:var(--light);}
.hero{min-height:100vh;background:var(--dark);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:120px 48px 80px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.hero-bg-glow{position:absolute;width:800px;height:800px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(193,74,28,.18) 0%,transparent 70%);top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);pointer-events:none;}
.hero-bg-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:60px 60px;pointer-events:none;}
.hero-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(193,74,28,.15);border:1px solid rgba(193,74,28,.3);color:white;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:32px;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s .2s forwards;}
.hero-badge-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand2);animation:pulse 2s infinite;flex-shrink:0;}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;}50%{opacity:.4;}}
.hero-h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5.2rem);font-weight:900;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.04em;color:#fff;max-width:950px;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s .4s forwards;}
.hero-h1 em{font-style:italic;font-weight:300;color:var(--brand2);}
.hero-h1 .accent{color:var(--brand2);}
.hero-sub{font-size:19px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);max-width:540px;line-height:1.65;margin-top:24px;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s .6s forwards;}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:44px;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s .8s forwards;}
.btn-hero-prim{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;transition:all .18s;}
.btn-hero-prim:hover{background:#a83d17;transform:translateY(-2px);}
.btn-hero-sec{background:transparent;color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);padding:15px 30px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);cursor:pointer;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;transition:all .18s;}
.btn-hero-sec:hover{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);color:#fff;}
.hero-stats{display:flex;gap:56px;margin-top:80px;padding-top:44px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s 1s forwards;}
.hero-stat-num{font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--brand2);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1;}
.hero-stat-label{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);margin-top:6px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.09em;}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
.clients-strip{background:var(--light);padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);overflow:hidden;}
.clients-label{text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#bbb;margin-bottom:20px;}
.marquee-track{display:flex;gap:56px;animation:marquee 30s linear infinite;width:max-content;}
.marquee-track:hover{animation-play-state:paused;}
.client-name{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ccc;white-space:nowrap;transition:color .2s;cursor:default;}
.client-name:hover{color:var(--dark);}
@keyframes marquee{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
section{padding:96px 56px;}
.section-inner{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;}
.section-eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand);margin-bottom:16px;}
.section-eyebrow::before{content:'>>>';font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.05em;}
.section-h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.8vw,3.2rem);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.08;color:var(--dark);}
.section-h2 em{font-style:italic;font-weight:300;color:var(--brand);}
.section-sub{font-size:17px;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.68;max-width:580px;margin-top:16px;}
.problems-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:52px;}
.problem-card{background:var(--light);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:30px 34px;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;transition:all .22s;cursor:default;}
.problem-card:hover{border-color:var(--brand);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(193,74,28,.08);}
.problem-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:7px;}
.problem-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:8px;}
.problem-text{font-size:14px;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.65;}
.services-section{background:var(--dark);}
.services-section .section-eyebrow{color:var(--brand2);}
.services-section .section-h2{color:#fff;}
.services-section .section-sub{color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);}
.services-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:56px;}
.service-card{background:var(--dark);padding:38px 32px;transition:background .25s;cursor:default;}
.service-card:hover{background:#181818;}
.service-num{font-size:3rem;font-weight:900;color:rgba(193,74,28,.13);letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;font-style:italic;}
.service-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:4px;}
.service-subtitle{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;margin-bottom:12px;}
.service-desc{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);line-height:1.68;}

/* MÉTODO ORBITAL */
.orbital-section{background:var(--dark);padding:96px 56px;}
.orbital-section .section-eyebrow{color:var(--brand2);}
.orbital-section .section-h2{color:#fff;}
.orbital-section .section-sub{color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);}
.orbital-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:64px;align-items:start;margin-top:60px;}
.orbital-map-wrap{position:sticky;top:100px;}
.orbital-svg-container{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;}
.orbital-svg-container svg{width:100%;height:auto;overflow:visible;}
.orbital-node{cursor:pointer;transition:all .25s;}
.orbital-node circle.ring{fill:none;stroke:var(--brand);stroke-width:2;transition:all .25s;}
.orbital-node circle.dot{fill:var(--brand);transition:all .25s;}
.orbital-node text{fill:rgba(255,255,255,.5);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;transition:all .25s;letter-spacing:.06em;}
.orbital-node.active circle.ring{stroke:var(--brand2);fill:rgba(193,74,28,.15);}
.orbital-node.active circle.dot{fill:var(--brand2);r:7;}
.orbital-node.active text{fill:#fff;}
.orbital-node:hover circle.ring{stroke:var(--brand2);}
.orbital-node:hover text{fill:rgba(255,255,255,.85);}
.orbital-phases{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;}
.orbital-phase{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);cursor:pointer;transition:all .25s;}
.orbital-phase:first-child{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);}
.orbital-phase-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;}
.orbital-phase-num{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand);letter-spacing:.1em;min-width:32px;}
.orbital-phase-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);transition:color .25s;flex:1;}
.orbital-phase-arrow{color:rgba(255,255,255,.2);font-size:14px;transition:all .25s;}
.orbital-phase.active .orbital-phase-title{color:#fff;}
.orbital-phase.active .orbital-phase-num{color:var(--brand2);}
.orbital-phase.active .orbital-phase-arrow{color:var(--brand2);transform:rotate(90deg);}
.orbital-phase:hover .orbital-phase-title{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);}
.orbital-phase-body{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease,opacity .3s ease;opacity:0;}
.orbital-phase.active .orbital-phase-body{max-height:400px;opacity:1;}
.orbital-phase-tagline{font-size:14px;font-style:italic;color:var(--brand2);margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:500;}
.orbital-phase-text{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);line-height:1.75;padding-bottom:20px;}
@media(max-width:1024px){.orbital-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.orbital-map-wrap{position:relative;top:0;max-width:400px;margin:0 auto 40px;}}
@media(max-width:768px){.orbital-section{padding:56px 20px;}.orbital-layout{gap:32px;}}

.calc-section{background:#0D0D0D;padding:96px 56px;}
.calc-section .section-eyebrow{color:var(--brand2);}
.calc-section .section-h2{color:#fff;}
.calc-section .section-sub{color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);}
.calc-wrapper{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px;margin-top:56px;align-items:start;}
.calc-inputs{background:#161616;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:18px;padding:32px;}
.calc-inputs-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;}
.calc-inputs-title::before{content:'\2699';font-size:16px;}
.calc-field{margin-bottom:22px;}
.calc-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.38);margin-bottom:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.calc-label-hint{font-size:10px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,.2);}
.calc-range-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;}
.calc-range{flex:1;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;height:5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:3px;outline:none;cursor:pointer;}
.calc-range::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:20px;height:20px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;border:3px solid #161616;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--brand);transition:transform .15s;}
.calc-range::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover{transform:scale(1.2);}
.calc-val{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand2);min-width:86px;text-align:right;letter-spacing:-.02em;}
.calc-benchmark{background:rgba(193,74,28,.07);border:1px solid rgba(193,74,28,.18);border-radius:9px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.38);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5;}
.calc-benchmark strong{color:var(--brand2);}
.calc-results{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;}
.result-hero-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(193,74,28,.16),rgba(232,82,26,.06));border:1px solid rgba(193,74,28,.22);border-radius:18px;padding:32px;text-align:center;}
.result-hero-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);margin-bottom:12px;}
.gauge-wrap{width:180px;height:90px;margin:0 auto 12px;}
.gauge-svg{width:180px;height:90px;}
.result-hero-num{font-size:4.5rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--brand2);letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1;transition:all .4s ease;}
.result-hero-unit{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);margin-top:6px;}
.result-cards-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;}
.mini-result{background:#161616;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;}
.mini-result-num{font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;}
.mini-result-label{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.32);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.45;}
.mini-result.hl{border-color:rgba(193,74,28,.28);background:rgba(193,74,28,.05);}
.mini-result.hl .mini-result-num{color:var(--brand2);}
.calc-insight{background:#161616;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;}
.calc-insight-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px;}
.insight-bullet{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);line-height:1.6;}
.insight-bullet:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
.insight-dot{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand2);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:6px;}
.calc-cta-strip{background:var(--brand);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;}
.calc-cta-text{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;}
.calc-cta-text span{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;opacity:.75;margin-top:3px;}
.calc-cta-btn{background:#fff;color:var(--brand);padding:11px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;transition:all .15s;flex-shrink:0;}
.calc-cta-btn:hover{background:#f5e8e3;}
.modal-overlay{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.7);z-index:200;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;}
.modal-overlay.open{display:flex;}
.modal{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:40px;width:100%;max-width:480px;position:relative;}
.modal-close{position:absolute;top:16px;right:16px;background:none;border:none;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--gray);}
.modal-close:hover{color:var(--dark);}
.modal-eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand);margin-bottom:12px;}
.modal-title{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:6px;}
.modal-sub{font-size:14px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:24px;line-height:1.5;}
.modal-field{margin-bottom:14px;}
.modal-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:6px;display:block;}
.modal-input{width:100%;padding:11px 14px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:9px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--dark);outline:none;transition:border-color .18s;}
.modal-input:focus{border-color:var(--brand);}
.modal-submit{width:100%;padding:14px;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:9px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .18s;}
.modal-submit:hover{background:#a83d17;}
.modal-submit:disabled{background:#aaa;cursor:not-allowed;}
.modal-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0;}
.modal-success-icon{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:12px;}
.modal-success-title{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:8px;}
.modal-success-text{font-size:14px;color:var(--gray);}
.diferencial-section{background:var(--light);}
.diferencial-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;align-items:center;margin-top:56px;}
.diferencial-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;}
.dif-item{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;padding:22px;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;transition:all .22s;cursor:default;}
.dif-item:hover{border-color:var(--brand);box-shadow:0 6px 28px rgba(193,74,28,.08);transform:translateY(-2px);}
.dif-icon{width:40px;height:40px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0;}
.dif-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:4px;}
.dif-text{font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.65;}
.diferencial-visual{background:var(--dark);border-radius:20px;padding:40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;}
.dif-v-title{font-size:28px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.12;}
.dif-v-title span{color:var(--brand2);}
.dif-metric-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;}
.dif-metric-lbl{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.28);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;}
.dif-metric{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
.dif-metric-bar{flex:1;height:5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;}
.dif-metric-fill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--brand),var(--brand2));border-radius:3px;}
.dif-metric-val{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand2);min-width:44px;text-align:right;}
.dif-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(193,74,28,.14);border:1px solid rgba(193,74,28,.24);color:var(--brand2);padding:9px 16px;border-radius:9px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;width:fit-content;margin-top:4px;}
.results-section{background:var(--white);}
.results-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--border);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:56px;}
.result-card{background:var(--white);padding:52px 40px;text-align:center;transition:background .2s;cursor:default;}
.result-card:hover{background:var(--light);}
.result-num{font-size:4rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--brand);letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1;}
.result-label{font-size:14px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.55;}
.blog-section{background:var(--white);}
.blog-top{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:0;}
.blog-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:48px;}
.blog-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;transition:all .22s;cursor:pointer;}
.blog-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 14px 48px rgba(193,74,28,.1);border-color:var(--brand);}
.blog-thumb{height:148px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FBF0EB,#F5DDD3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2.5rem;position:relative;}
.blog-cat{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:5px;}
.blog-body{padding:20px;}
.blog-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:8px;}
.blog-excerpt{font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:14px;}
.blog-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}
.blog-date{font-size:11px;color:#bbb;}
.blog-read{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;}
.cta-section{background:var(--dark);padding:96px 56px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.cta-section::before{content:'';position:absolute;width:700px;height:700px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(193,74,28,.18) 0%,transparent 70%);top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);pointer-events:none;}
.cta-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand2);margin-bottom:16px;}
.cta-h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,4rem);font-weight:900;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1.05;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 16px;}
.cta-h2 em{font-style:italic;font-weight:300;color:var(--brand2);}
.cta-sub{font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);max-width:480px;margin:0 auto 40px;}
.cta-note{margin-top:16px;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.18);}
footer{background:#070707;padding:60px 56px 32px;}
.footer-inner{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;}
.footer-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.7fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:48px;padding-bottom:48px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);}
.footer-logo-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px;}
.footer-logo-wrap img{height:26px;display:block;filter:brightness(0) invert(1);opacity:.8;}
.footer-tagline{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.28);line-height:1.65;max-width:230px;}
.footer-contact a{display:block;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.28);text-decoration:none;margin-top:9px;transition:color .15s;}
.footer-contact a:hover{color:var(--brand2);}
.footer-col-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);margin-bottom:14px;}
.footer-col a{display:block;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.28);text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:10px;cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s;}
.footer-col a:hover{color:#fff;}
.footer-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:28px;}
.footer-copy{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.16);}
.footer-social{display:flex;gap:10px;}
.social-btn{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:7px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);text-decoration:none;transition:all .15s;}
.social-btn:hover{border-color:var(--brand);color:var(--brand2);}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:opacity .75s ease,transform .75s ease;}
.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
.d1{transition-delay:.1s;}.d2{transition-delay:.2s;}.d3{transition-delay:.3s;}.d4{transition-delay:.4s;}.d5{transition-delay:.5s;}
@media(max-width:1024px){nav{padding:14px 28px;}section,.calc-section,.cta-section{padding:72px 28px;}footer{padding:48px 28px 28px;}.services-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}.diferencial-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px;}.calc-wrapper{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.footer-top{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px;}.hero-stats{gap:36px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;}}
@media(max-width:768px){nav{padding:12px 20px;}.nav-links,#nav-cta-desk{display:none;}.hamburger{display:flex;}.nav-logo img{height:36px;}.hero{padding:100px 20px 56px;}.hero-h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,9vw,3rem);}.hero-sub{font-size:16px;}.hero-actions{flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:100%;max-width:320px;}.btn-hero-prim,.btn-hero-sec{width:100%;text-align:center;padding:14px 20px;}.hero-stats{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px 36px;justify-content:center;margin-top:48px;padding-top:32px;}.hero-stat-num{font-size:2rem;}section,.calc-section,.cta-section{padding:56px 20px;}.section-h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,7vw,2.4rem);}.problems-grid,.services-grid,.results-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.service-card{padding:28px 22px;}.calc-wrapper{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;}.calc-inputs{padding:22px 18px;}.result-hero-num{font-size:3.5rem;}.calc-cta-strip{flex-direction:column;text-align:center;}.diferencial-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;}.diferencial-visual{padding:28px 22px;}.result-card{padding:36px 24px;}.blog-top{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;}.blog-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.cta-h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,7vw,2.6rem);}.footer-top{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;}.footer-bottom{flex-direction:column;gap:14px;text-align:center;}.modal{padding:28px 20px;}}
@media(max-width:400px){.result-cards-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.hero-h1{font-size:1.9rem;}}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:6px;}::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:#111;}::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#2a2a2a;border-radius:3px;}

#dc-clientes::-webkit-slider-thumb,#dc-ticket::-webkit-slider-thumb,
#dc-email::-webkit-slider-thumb,#dc-whatsapp::-webkit-slider-thumb,
#dc-cumple::-webkit-slider-thumb{
  -webkit-appearance:none;width:20px;height:20px;background:var(--brand);
  border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;border:3px solid white;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--brand);transition:transform .15s;
}
#dc-clientes::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover,#dc-ticket::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover,
#dc-email::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover,#dc-whatsapp::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover,
#dc-cumple::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover{transform:scale(1.2);}
@media(max-width:768px){
  #calculadora-datos .section-inner>div:last-child{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;}
  #calculadora-datos .section-inner>div:nth-child(2){grid-template-columns:1fr!important;}
}

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-overlay" onclick="closeModalOutside(event)">
  <div class="modal">
    <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeModal()">&#10005;</button>
    <div id="modal-form-wrap">
      <div class="modal-eyebrow">&gt;&gt;&gt; Contacto</div>
      <div class="modal-title">Hablemos de tu negocio</div>
      <div class="modal-sub">Complet&#225; tus datos y te contactamos en menos de 24 hs.</div>
      <form onsubmit="sendForm(event)">
        <div class="modal-field"><label class="modal-label">Nombre</label><input class="modal-input" id="fn" type="text" placeholder="Tu nombre" required></div>
        <div class="modal-field"><label class="modal-label">Email</label><input class="modal-input" id="fe" type="email" placeholder="tu@empresa.com" required></div>
        <div class="modal-field"><label class="modal-label">Empresa</label><input class="modal-input" id="fc" placeholder="Nombre de tu empresa"></div>
        <div class="modal-field"><label class="modal-label">Mensaje</label><input class="modal-input" id="fm" placeholder="&#191;En qu&#233; te podemos ayudar?"></div>
        <button class="modal-submit" id="fbtn" type="submit">Enviar mensaje &#8594;</button>
      </form>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-success" id="modal-success">
      <div class="modal-success-icon">&#9989;</div>
      <div class="modal-success-title">&#161;Mensaje enviado!</div>
      <div class="modal-success-text">Gracias, te respondemos a <strong id="fok"></strong> en menos de 24 hs.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<nav>
  <a class="nav-logo" href="#"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Segmentya"></a>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <button class="nav-link" onclick="goTo('servicios')">Servicios</button>
    <button class="nav-link" onclick="goTo('metodo-orbital')" style="color:var(--brand);font-weight:700;">M&#233;todo Orbital</button>
    <button class="nav-link" onclick="goTo('calculadora-datos')">Valor de Datos</button><button class="nav-link" onclick="goTo('calculadora')">Calculadora</button>
    <button class="nav-link" onclick="goTo('diferencial')">Diferencial</button>
    <button class="nav-link" onclick="goTo('blog')">Blog</button>
    <button class="nav-link" onclick="openModal()">Contacto</button>
  </div>
  <button class="nav-cta" id="nav-cta-desk" onclick="openModal()">Hablemos &#8594;</button>
  <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" onclick="toggleMenu()"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
</nav>

<div class="mobile-menu" id="mobile-menu">
  <button class="mobile-link" onclick="goTo('servicios');toggleMenu()">Servicios</button>
  <button class="mobile-link" onclick="goTo('metodo-orbital');toggleMenu()" style="color:var(--brand);font-weight:700;">M&#233;todo Orbital</button>
  <button class="mobile-link" onclick="goTo('calculadora');toggleMenu()">Calculadora</button>
  <button class="mobile-link" onclick="goTo('diferencial');toggleMenu()">Diferencial</button>
  <button class="mobile-link" onclick="goTo('blog');toggleMenu()">Blog</button>
  <button class="mobile-link" onclick="openModal();toggleMenu()">Contacto</button>
  <button class="nav-cta" style="margin-top:8px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;" onclick="openModal();toggleMenu()">Hablemos &#8594;</button>
</div>

<section class="hero" id="inicio">
  <div class="hero-bg-grid"></div><div class="hero-bg-glow"></div>
  <div class="hero-badge"><div class="hero-badge-dot"></div>WoowUp Partner Oficial</div>
  <h1 class="hero-h1">Transformamos datos<br>en <em>relaciones</em> y relaciones<br>en <span class="accent">rentabilidad.</span></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Potenci&#225; tu base de clientes con CRM, segmentaci&#243;n inteligente y estrategias que generan recurrencia real.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <button class="btn-hero-prim" onclick="openModal()">Empezar ahora &#8594;</button>
    <button class="btn-hero-sec" onclick="goTo('calculadora')">Calcul&#225; tu p&#233;rdida &#8595;</button>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div><div class="hero-stat-num">+35%</div><div class="hero-stat-label">Engagement campa&#241;as</div></div>
    <div><div class="hero-stat-num">+20%</div><div class="hero-stat-label">Retenci&#243;n anual</div></div>
    <div><div class="hero-stat-num">3&#215;</div><div class="hero-stat-label">ROI en CRM</div></div>
    <div><div class="hero-stat-num">+50</div><div class="hero-stat-label">Marcas activas</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ORBITAL TEASER STRIP -->
<div style="background:var(--brand);padding:20px 56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;">
    <div style="width:40px;height:40px;flex-shrink:0;">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 380 380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:40px;height:40px;">
        <circle cx="190" cy="190" r="5" fill="white" opacity="0.9"/>
        <path d="M 190 168 A 22 22 0 1 1 168 190" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.5"/>
        <path d="M 190 148 A 42 42 0 1 1 148 190" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.65"/>
        <path d="M 190 126 A 64 64 0 1 1 126 190" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.8"/>
        <path d="M 190 104 A 86 86 0 1 1 110 218" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="1" marker-end="url(#arr)"/>
        <defs><marker id="arr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="4" markerHeight="4" orient="auto"><path d="M2 1L8 5L2 9" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></marker></defs>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);margin-bottom:3px;">Nuevo</div>
      <div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:white;letter-spacing:-.02em;">M&#233;todo Orbital</div>
      <div style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:2px;">El sistema de marketing basado en datos que aprende con cada ciclo.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <button onclick="goTo('metodo-orbital')" style="background:white;color:var(--brand);padding:10px 22px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;transition:all .18s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='#f5e8e3'" onmouseout="this.style.background='white'">Ver el m&#233;todo &#8594;</button>
</div>

<div class="clients-strip">
  <div class="clients-label">Conf&#237;an en nosotros</div>
  <div style="overflow:hidden"><div class="marquee-track">
    <span class="client-name">Parfumerie.</span><span class="client-name">Stanley</span><span class="client-name">Quiksilver</span><span class="client-name">TOUS</span><span class="client-name">Lamy</span><span class="client-name">Edding</span><span class="client-name">DC</span><span class="client-name">Roxy</span><span class="client-name">Ala Moana</span><span class="client-name">RVCA</span><span class="client-name">FarmaFull</span><span class="client-name">Funat</span>
    <span class="client-name">Parfumerie.</span><span class="client-name">Stanley</span><span class="client-name">Quiksilver</span><span class="client-name">TOUS</span><span class="client-name">Lamy</span><span class="client-name">Edding</span><span class="client-name">DC</span><span class="client-name">Roxy</span><span class="client-name">Ala Moana</span><span class="client-name">FarmaFull</span><span class="client-name">Funat</span><span class="client-name">RVCA</span>
  </div></div>
</div>

<section id="problemas" style="background:var(--white);">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="reveal"><div class="section-eyebrow">&#191;Te identific&#225;s?</div><h2 class="section-h2">Los problemas que<br>venimos a <em>resolver</em>.</h2><p class="section-sub">La mayor&#237;a de las empresas dejan dinero sobre la mesa por no aprovechar los datos que ya tienen.</p></div>
    <div class="problems-grid">
      <div class="problem-card reveal d1"><div class="problem-dot"></div><div><div class="problem-title">Equipos multitarea</div><div class="problem-text">No hay foco en el CRM al 100%. El equipo atiende mil frentes y nadie se hace cargo de retener clientes.</div></div></div>
      <div class="problem-card reveal d2"><div class="problem-dot"></div><div><div class="problem-title">Baja frecuencia de recompra</div><div class="problem-text">Muchos clientes compran una sola vez. La base crece pero la recurrencia no acompa&#241;a.</div></div></div>
      <div class="problem-card reveal d3"><div class="problem-dot"></div><div><div class="problem-title">Clientes saturados de mensajes</div><div class="problem-text">Comunicaciones gen&#233;ricas que no segmentan ni personalizan. El cliente se desuscribe o ignora.</div></div></div>
      <div class="problem-card reveal d4"><div class="problem-dot"></div><div><div class="problem-title">Publicidad cada vez m&#225;s cara</div><div class="problem-text">El CPA sube y la adquisici&#243;n de nuevos clientes se vuelve insostenible sin retener los actuales.</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services-section" id="servicios">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="reveal"><div class="section-eyebrow">Servicios</div><h2 class="section-h2">Todo lo que necesit&#225;s<br>para escalar tu <em>CRM</em>.</h2><p class="section-sub">Desde el setup inicial hasta la ejecuci&#243;n completa. Nos adaptamos a donde est&#225;s y a donde quer&#233;s llegar.</p></div>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card reveal d1"><div class="service-num">01</div><div class="service-title">Data-Driven CRM</div><div class="service-subtitle">Estrategia basada en datos</div><div class="service-desc">An&#225;lisis estrat&#233;gico de tu base de clientes con reuniones semanales para interpretar resultados y descubrir oportunidades comerciales.</div></div>
      <div class="service-card reveal d2"><div class="service-num">02</div><div class="service-title">Done-For-You</div><div class="service-subtitle">Ejecuci&#243;n CRM Premium</div><div class="service-desc">Gesti&#243;n completa de campa&#241;as: creaci&#243;n, segmentaci&#243;n, maquetaci&#243;n y env&#237;o. Vos solo te enfo&#231;&#225;s en los resultados.</div></div>
      <div class="service-card reveal d3"><div class="service-num">03</div><div class="service-title">Growth Engine</div><div class="service-subtitle">Estrategia + Optimizaci&#243;n</div><div class="service-desc">Impulsamos tu WoowUp con auditor&#237;as, benchmarking contra tu industria y planes estrat&#233;gicos para acelerar el crecimiento.</div></div>
      <div class="service-card reveal d1"><div class="service-num">04</div><div class="service-title">Ramp-up</div><div class="service-subtitle">Setup + Onboarding CRM</div><div class="service-desc">Setup inicial y onboarding completo configurando workflows esenciales y capacitando a tu equipo desde el d&#237;a cero.</div></div>
      <div class="service-card reveal d2"><div class="service-num">05</div><div class="service-title">M&#233;todo Orbital</div><div class="service-subtitle">Sistema de marketing basado en datos</div><div class="service-desc">Un ciclo continuo de an&#225;lisis, estrategia y ejecuci&#243;n. Cada vuelta aprende. Cada ciclo es m&#225;s preciso que el anterior.</div></div>
      <div class="service-card reveal d3"><div class="service-num">06</div><div class="service-title">Data Expansion</div><div class="service-subtitle">Captura de nuevos datos</div><div class="service-desc">An&#225;lisis y mejora de tu recolecci&#243;n de datos en todos los puntos de contacto: tiendas f&#237;sicas y canales digitales.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="orbital-section" id="metodo-orbital">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">M&#233;todo Orbital</div>
      <h2 class="section-h2">El sistema que conecta<br>an&#225;lisis, estrategia y <em>ejecuci&#243;n</em>.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Cada vuelta aprende. Cada ciclo es m&#225;s preciso que el anterior.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="orbital-layout">

      <!-- MAPA ORBITAL INTERACTIVO -->
      <div class="orbital-map-wrap reveal d1">
        <div class="orbital-svg-container">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 380 380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <defs>
              <marker id="orb-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto">
                <path d="M2 1L8 5L2 9" fill="none" stroke="#C14A1C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </marker>
              <radialGradient id="glow-1" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#C14A1C" stop-opacity="0.2"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#C14A1C" stop-opacity="0"/>
              </radialGradient>
            </defs>

            <!-- Centro -->
            <circle cx="190" cy="190" r="6" fill="#C14A1C" opacity="1"/>
            <circle cx="190" cy="190" r="12" fill="rgba(193,74,28,.15)" stroke="rgba(193,74,28,.3)" stroke-width="1"/>

            <!-- Espiral arco 1 — radio 42 -->
            <path d="M 190 148 A 42 42 0 1 1 148 190" fill="none" stroke="#C14A1C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.25"/>
            <!-- Espiral arco 2 — radio 75 -->
            <path d="M 190 115 A 75 75 0 1 1 115 190" fill="none" stroke="#C14A1C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.4"/>
            <!-- Espiral arco 3 — radio 108 -->
            <path d="M 190 82 A 108 108 0 1 1 82 190" fill="none" stroke="#C14A1C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.55"/>
            <!-- Espiral arco 4 — radio 142 — con flecha -->
            <path d="M 190 48 A 142 142 0 1 1 62 228" fill="none" stroke="#C14A1C" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.8" marker-end="url(#orb-arrow)"/>

            <!-- NODO 01 — El Origen — arriba (0°) radio 42 -->
            <g class="orbital-node active" id="node-1" onclick="selectPhase(1)" transform="translate(190,148)">
              <circle class="ring" r="20" />
              <circle class="dot" r="5"/>
              <text x="26" y="4" text-anchor="start">01</text>
              <text x="26" y="17" text-anchor="start" style="font-size:9px;fill:rgba(255,255,255,.35);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">EL ORIGEN</text>
            </g>

            <!-- NODO 02 — Trazado — derecha (90°) radio 75 -->
            <g class="orbital-node" id="node-2" onclick="selectPhase(2)" transform="translate(265,190)">
              <circle class="ring" r="20"/>
              <circle class="dot" r="5"/>
              <text x="26" y="4" text-anchor="start">02</text>
              <text x="26" y="17" text-anchor="start" style="font-size:9px;fill:rgba(255,255,255,.35);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">TRAZADO</text>
            </g>

            <!-- NODO 03 — Impulso — abajo (180°) radio 108 -->
            <g class="orbital-node" id="node-3" onclick="selectPhase(3)" transform="translate(190,298)">
              <circle class="ring" r="20"/>
              <circle class="dot" r="5"/>
              <text x="26" y="4" text-anchor="start">03</text>
              <text x="26" y="17" text-anchor="start" style="font-size:9px;fill:rgba(255,255,255,.35);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">IMPULSO</text>
            </g>

            <!-- NODO 04 — Señales — izquierda (270°) radio 142 -->
            <g class="orbital-node" id="node-4" onclick="selectPhase(4)" transform="translate(48,190)">
              <circle class="ring" r="20"/>
              <circle class="dot" r="5"/>
              <text x="-26" y="4" text-anchor="end">04</text>
              <text x="-26" y="17" text-anchor="end" style="font-size:9px;fill:rgba(255,255,255,.35);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">SE&#209;ALES</text>
            </g>

            <!-- NODO 05 — Reórbita — arriba-izq (315°) radio 142 -->
            <g class="orbital-node" id="node-5" onclick="selectPhase(5)" transform="translate(90,90)">
              <circle class="ring" r="20"/>
              <circle class="dot" r="5"/>
              <text x="-26" y="4" text-anchor="end">05</text>
              <text x="-26" y="17" text-anchor="end" style="font-size:9px;fill:rgba(255,255,255,.35);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">RE&#211;RBITA</text>
            </g>

            <!-- Label central -->
            <text x="190" y="175" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Inter',sans-serif" font-size="8" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="2" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.2)" text-transform="uppercase">M&#201;TODO</text>
            <text x="190" y="185" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Inter',sans-serif" font-size="8" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="2" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.2)">ORBITAL</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FASES ACCORDION -->
      <div class="orbital-phases reveal d2">

        <div class="orbital-phase active" id="phase-1" onclick="selectPhase(1)">
          <div class="orbital-phase-header">
            <div class="orbital-phase-num">01</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-title">El Origen</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-arrow">&#8250;</div>
          </div>
          <div class="orbital-phase-body">
            <div class="orbital-phase-tagline">Nada empieza sin entender d&#243;nde est&#225;s parado.</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-text">Antes de cualquier acci&#243;n, el negocio se estudia en profundidad. Datos de ventas, comportamiento de clientes, contexto competitivo, canales activos. Nada queda oculto.<br><br>El Origen no es una reuni&#243;n de briefing &#8212; es una radiograf&#237;a. Porque una estrategia construida sobre datos reales llega m&#225;s lejos que una construida sobre suposiciones.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="orbital-phase" id="phase-2" onclick="selectPhase(2)">
          <div class="orbital-phase-header">
            <div class="orbital-phase-num">02</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-title">Trazado</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-arrow">&#8250;</div>
          </div>
          <div class="orbital-phase-body">
            <div class="orbital-phase-tagline">No es un plan. Es una construcci&#243;n con direcci&#243;n y prop&#243;sito.</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-text">Con el negocio entendido, se dise&#241;a la arquitectura estrat&#233;gica: audiencias, mensajes, canales y flujos de trabajo con IA aplicada. Cada decisi&#243;n tiene una raz&#243;n. Cada acci&#243;n, un destino.<br><br>El Trazado convierte los datos del Origen en una ruta clara &#8212; sin margen para la improvisaci&#243;n.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="orbital-phase" id="phase-3" onclick="selectPhase(3)">
          <div class="orbital-phase-header">
            <div class="orbital-phase-num">03</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-title">Impulso</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-arrow">&#8250;</div>
          </div>
          <div class="orbital-phase-body">
            <div class="orbital-phase-tagline">Donde las ideas dejan de ser ideas.</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-text">La estrategia toca el suelo. Se activan campa&#241;as, se despliegan flujos, se ejecutan las acciones definidas en el Trazado. El Impulso no se improvisa &#8212; se lanza con la precisi&#243;n que construyeron las fases anteriores.<br><br>Es el momento en que el m&#233;todo se vuelve visible para el cliente.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="orbital-phase" id="phase-4" onclick="selectPhase(4)">
          <div class="orbital-phase-header">
            <div class="orbital-phase-num">04</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-title">Se&#241;ales</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-arrow">&#8250;</div>
          </div>
          <div class="orbital-phase-body">
            <div class="orbital-phase-tagline">Los resultados no esperan al informe del mes.</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-text">Seguimiento en tiempo real, m&#233;tricas vivas, ajustes sobre la marcha. Las Se&#241;ales mantienen el pulso activo del ciclo: qu&#233; est&#225; funcionando, qu&#233; necesita correcci&#243;n, d&#243;nde est&#225;n las oportunidades de retenci&#243;n y activaci&#243;n.<br><br>El sistema no duerme. Las decisiones se toman con datos frescos.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="orbital-phase" id="phase-5" onclick="selectPhase(5)">
          <div class="orbital-phase-header">
            <div class="orbital-phase-num">05</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-title">Re&#243;rbita</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-arrow">&#8250;</div>
          </div>
          <div class="orbital-phase-body">
            <div class="orbital-phase-tagline">Lo que aprendiste no se archiva. Se convierte en el pr&#243;ximo punto de partida.</div>
            <div class="orbital-phase-text">Cada ciclo deposita inteligencia en el sistema. La Re&#243;rbita transforma los aprendizajes de las Se&#241;ales en un nuevo Origen &#8212; m&#225;s informado, m&#225;s preciso, m&#225;s efectivo que el anterior.<br><br>As&#237; es como el M&#233;todo Orbital se reinventa con cada vuelta. Y as&#237; es como tu negocio crece con cada ciclo.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ══ CALCULADORA DE VALOR DE DATOS ══ -->
<section id="calculadora-datos" style="background:#F7F6F4;padding:96px 56px;">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Calculadora</div>
      <h2 class="section-h2">¿Cuánto vale <em>completar</em><br>el perfil de tus clientes?</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Cada dato adicional que capturás activa un canal nuevo. Calculá el revenue incremental de tener una base más completa.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- BENCHMARKS -->
    <div class="reveal d1" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:48px;">
      <div style="background:white;border:1px solid #EBEBEB;border-radius:14px;padding:24px 28px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;">
        <div style="width:44px;height:44px;background:#F0FAF5;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:20px;">👁</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#C14A1C;letter-spacing:-.03em;">+60% <span style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#5A5A5A;">de apertura</span></div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:#5A5A5A;line-height:1.55;margin-top:4px;">Los mensajes enviados al segmento adecuado tienen una probabilidad mucho mayor de ser vistos.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:white;border:1px solid #EBEBEB;border-radius:14px;padding:24px 28px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;">
        <div style="width:44px;height:44px;background:#F0FAF5;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:20px;">🖱</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#C14A1C;letter-spacing:-.03em;">+20% <span style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#5A5A5A;">de clics</span></div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:#5A5A5A;line-height:1.55;margin-top:4px;">Cuando el mensaje se siente útil y oportuno, el cliente responde. La clave está en el match entre oferta y segmento.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:white;border:1px solid #EBEBEB;border-radius:14px;padding:24px 28px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;">
        <div style="width:44px;height:44px;background:#F0FAF5;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:20px;">🛍</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#C14A1C;letter-spacing:-.03em;">+5% <span style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#5A5A5A;">de conversión</span></div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:#5A5A5A;line-height:1.55;margin-top:4px;">Las campañas con segmentación precisa y mensajes relevantes muestran un rendimiento superior.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CALC GRID -->
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px;align-items:start;" class="reveal d2">

      <!-- INPUTS -->
      <div style="background:white;border:1px solid #EBEBEB;border-radius:18px;padding:32px;">
        <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0F0F0F;margin-bottom:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;">⚙ Parámetros de tu base</div>

        <!-- Clientes totales -->
        <div style="margin-bottom:22px;">
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888;margin-bottom:9px;">Clientes en tu base</div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;">
            <input type="range" id="dc-clientes" min="500" max="100000" step="500" value="10000" oninput="dcUpdate()" style="flex:1;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;height:5px;background:#EBEBEB;border-radius:3px;outline:none;cursor:pointer;">
            <div id="dv-clientes" style="font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#E8521A;min-width:86px;text-align:right;">10.000</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Ticket promedio -->
        <div style="margin-bottom:22px;">
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888;margin-bottom:9px;">Ticket promedio (ARS)</div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;">
            <input type="range" id="dc-ticket" min="5000" max="200000" step="5000" value="35000" oninput="dcUpdate()" style="flex:1;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;height:5px;background:#EBEBEB;border-radius:3px;outline:none;cursor:pointer;">
            <div id="dv-ticket" style="font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#E8521A;min-width:86px;text-align:right;">$35K</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- % con email -->
        <div style="margin-bottom:22px;">
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;">
            📧 Clientes con email
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;">
            <input type="range" id="dc-email" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="60" oninput="dcUpdate()" style="flex:1;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;height:5px;background:#EBEBEB;border-radius:3px;outline:none;cursor:pointer;">
            <div id="dv-email" style="font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#E8521A;min-width:86px;text-align:right;">60%</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:rgba(193,74,28,.07);border:1px solid rgba(193,74,28,.18);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 13px;font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5;">
            📊 Benchmark: <strong style="color:#E8521A;">55%–75%</strong> de bases activas tienen email capturado
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- % con WhatsApp -->
        <div style="margin-bottom:22px;">
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888;margin-bottom:6px;">
            💬 Clientes con WhatsApp
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;">
            <input type="range" id="dc-whatsapp" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="30" oninput="dcUpdate()" style="flex:1;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;height:5px;background:#EBEBEB;border-radius:3px;outline:none;cursor:pointer;">
            <div id="dv-whatsapp" style="font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#E8521A;min-width:86px;text-align:right;">30%</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:rgba(193,74,28,.07);border:1px solid rgba(193,74,28,.18);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 13px;font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5;">
            📲 WhatsApp tiene <strong style="color:#E8521A;">98% de tasa de apertura</strong> vs 20% del email promedio
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- % con fecha de nacimiento -->
        <div style="margin-bottom:0;">
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888;margin-bottom:6px;">
            🎂 Clientes con fecha de nacimiento
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;">
            <input type="range" id="dc-cumple" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="20" oninput="dcUpdate()" style="flex:1;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;height:5px;background:#EBEBEB;border-radius:3px;outline:none;cursor:pointer;">
            <div id="dv-cumple" style="font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#E8521A;min-width:86px;text-align:right;">20%</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:rgba(193,74,28,.07);border:1px solid rgba(193,74,28,.18);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 13px;font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5;">
            🎁 Campañas de cumpleaños logran <strong style="color:#E8521A;">3× más conversión</strong> que campañas genéricas
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RESULTADOS -->
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">

        <!-- Score de completitud -->
        <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FBF0EB,#F5DDD3);border:1px solid rgba(193,74,28,.2);border-radius:18px;padding:28px;text-align:center;">
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(193,74,28,.7);margin-bottom:10px;">Score de completitud de tu base</div>
          <div id="dc-score" style="font-size:5rem;font-weight:900;color:#C14A1C;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1;transition:all .4s;">37%</div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;height:10px;overflow:hidden;">
            <div id="dc-score-bar" style="height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#C14A1C,#E8521A);border-radius:8px;transition:width .6s ease;width:37%;"></div>
          </div>
          <div id="dc-score-label" style="font-size:13px;color:#5A5A5A;margin-top:10px;">Base con oportunidad de mejora</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Revenue por canal -->
        <div style="background:white;border:1px solid #EBEBEB;border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;">
          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0F0F0F;margin-bottom:16px;">Revenue potencial por canal (anual)</div>

          <div style="margin-bottom:12px;">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px;">
              <span style="font-size:12px;color:#5A5A5A;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;">📧 Email marketing</span>
              <span id="dc-rev-email" style="font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#0F0F0F;">$0</span>
            </div>
            <div style="height:5px;background:#EBEBEB;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;">
              <div id="dc-bar-email" style="height:100%;background:#C14A1C;border-radius:3px;transition:width .5s ease;width:0%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom:12px;">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px;">
              <span style="font-size:12px;color:#5A5A5A;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;">💬 WhatsApp marketing</span>
              <span id="dc-rev-wsp" style="font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#0F0F0F;">$0</span>
            </div>
            <div style="height:5px;background:#EBEBEB;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;">
              <div id="dc-bar-wsp" style="height:100%;background:#25D366;border-radius:3px;transition:width .5s ease;width:0%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom:4px;">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px;">
              <span style="font-size:12px;color:#5A5A5A;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;">🎂 Campañas de cumpleaños</span>
              <span id="dc-rev-cumple" style="font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#0F0F0F;">$0</span>
            </div>
            <div style="height:5px;background:#EBEBEB;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;">
              <div id="dc-bar-cumple" style="height:100%;background:#E8521A;border-radius:3px;transition:width .5s ease;width:0%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="border-top:1px solid #EBEBEB;margin-top:14px;padding-top:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
            <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#888;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;">Total estimado</span>
            <span id="dc-rev-total" style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#C14A1C;letter-spacing:-.03em;">$0</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Oportunidad perdida -->
        <div style="background:white;border:1px solid #EBEBEB;border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;">
          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0F0F0F;margin-bottom:14px;">💡 Oportunidad no capturada</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:#5A5A5A;line-height:1.65;" id="dc-insight-1">Ajustá los parámetros para ver el análisis.</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:#5A5A5A;line-height:1.65;margin-top:8px;" id="dc-insight-2"></div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:#5A5A5A;line-height:1.65;margin-top:8px;" id="dc-insight-3"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <div style="background:#C14A1C;border-radius:14px;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:white;">¿Querés completar tu base?</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:3px;">Te mostramos cómo en 30 minutos</div>
          </div>
          <button onclick="openModal()" style="background:white;color:#C14A1C;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;transition:all .15s;flex-shrink:0;" onmouseover="this.style.background='#f5e8e3'" onmouseout="this.style.background='white'">Agendar call →</button>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="calc-section" id="calculadora">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="reveal"><div class="section-eyebrow">Calculadora</div><h2 class="section-h2">&#191;Cu&#225;ntos clientes est&#225;s<br><em>perdiendo</em> en tienda?</h2><p class="section-sub">Calcul&#225; el impacto real de no recolectar datos en tus puntos de venta f&#237;sicos. Basado en benchmarks de retail latinoamericano.</p></div>
    <div class="calc-wrapper">
      <div class="calc-inputs reveal d1">
        <div class="calc-inputs-title">Par&#225;metros de tu negocio</div>
        <div class="calc-field"><div class="calc-label">Visitas diarias por tienda <span class="calc-label-hint">&#8212; personas que ingresan</span></div><div class="calc-range-row"><input type="range" class="calc-range" id="r-visitas" min="50" max="2000" step="50" value="300" oninput="calcUpdate()"><div class="calc-val" id="v-visitas">300</div></div><div class="calc-benchmark">&#128202; Benchmark retail ARG/LATAM: <strong>150&#8211;800 visitas/d&#237;a</strong> seg&#250;n formato y zona</div></div>
        <div class="calc-field"><div class="calc-label">Cantidad de tiendas</div><div class="calc-range-row"><input type="range" class="calc-range" id="r-tiendas" min="1" max="50" step="1" value="5" oninput="calcUpdate()"><div class="calc-val" id="v-tiendas">5</div></div></div>
        <div class="calc-field"><div class="calc-label">Ticket promedio <span class="calc-label-hint">&#8212; por transacci&#243;n en ARS</span></div><div class="calc-range-row"><input type="range" class="calc-range" id="r-ticket" min="5000" max="200000" step="5000" value="35000" oninput="calcUpdate()"><div class="calc-val" id="v-ticket">$35K</div></div></div>
        </div>
      <div class="calc-results reveal d2">
        <div class="result-hero-card">
          <div class="result-hero-label">Clientes perdidos por mes (todas las tiendas)</div>
          <div class="gauge-wrap"><svg class="gauge-svg" viewBox="0 0 180 90"><path d="M 12 82 A 78 78 0 0 1 168 82" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.05)" stroke-width="11" stroke-linecap="round"/><path id="gauge-arc" d="M 12 82 A 78 78 0 0 1 168 82" fill="none" stroke="url(#ggrad)" stroke-width="11" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="245" stroke-dashoffset="245" style="transition:stroke-dashoffset .7s ease"/><defs><linearGradient id="ggrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#C14A1C"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#E8521A"/></linearGradient></defs></svg></div>
          <div class="result-hero-num" id="r-mes">&#8212;</div>
          <div class="result-hero-unit">contactos no captados este mes</div>
        </div>
        <div class="result-cards-grid">
          <div class="mini-result"><div class="mini-result-num" id="r-ano">&#8212;</div><div class="mini-result-label">Contactos perdidos por a&#241;o</div></div>
          <div class="mini-result hl"><div class="mini-result-num" id="r-gap">&#8212;</div><div class="mini-result-label">Gap vs potencial de captura</div></div>
          <div class="mini-result hl"><div class="mini-result-num" id="r-rev">&#8212;</div><div class="mini-result-label">Revenue perdido anual estimado</div></div>
          <div class="mini-result"><div class="mini-result-num" id="r-ltv">&#8212;</div><div class="mini-result-label">LTV promedio por cliente no captado</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="calc-insight">
          <div class="calc-insight-title">&#128161; &#191;Qu&#233; significa esto?</div>
          <div class="insight-bullet"><div class="insight-dot"></div><span id="ins-1">Ajust&#225; los par&#225;metros para ver el an&#225;lisis personalizado.</span></div>
          <div class="insight-bullet"><div class="insight-dot"></div><span id="ins-2">&#8212;</span></div>
          <div class="insight-bullet"><div class="insight-dot"></div><span id="ins-3">&#8212;</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="calc-cta-strip">
          <div class="calc-cta-text">&#191;Quer&#233;s reducir esta p&#233;rdida?<span>Te mostramos c&#243;mo en 30 minutos gratis</span></div>
          <button class="calc-cta-btn" onclick="openModal()">Agendar call &#8594;</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="diferencial-section" id="diferencial">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="reveal"><div class="section-eyebrow">Nuestro diferencial</div><h2 class="section-h2">Especialistas en datos.<br>No somos una <em>agencia 360</em>.</h2></div>
    <div class="diferencial-layout">
      <div class="diferencial-list">
        <div class="dif-item reveal d1"><div class="dif-icon">&#127919;</div><div><div class="dif-title">M&#233;todo Orbital</div><div class="dif-text">Un sistema de ciclos continuos que conecta an&#225;lisis, estrategia y ejecuci&#243;n. Cada vuelta aprende y el siguiente ciclo es m&#225;s preciso.</div></div></div>
        <div class="dif-item reveal d2"><div class="dif-icon">&#128202;</div><div><div class="dif-title">Enfoque ROI-driven</div><div class="dif-text">Datos, automatizaci&#243;n y creatividad para maximizar LTV y minimizar CPA por cliente recurrente.</div></div></div>
